{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 31,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Ceremonially Unclean Persons Isolated"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spoke to Moses, saying: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Command the children of Israel that they put out of the camp every leper, everyone who has a discharge, and whoever becomes defiled "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "by contact with"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "by a corpse. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You shall put out both male and female; you shall put them outside the camp, that they may not defile their camps in the midst of which I dwell.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the children of Israel did so, and put them outside the camp; as the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spoke to Moses, so the children of Israel did."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Confession and Restitution"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spoke to Moses, saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Speak to the children of Israel: ‘When a man or woman commits any sin that men commit in unfaithfulness against the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", and that person is guilty, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "then he shall confess the sin which he has committed. He shall make restitution for his trespass in full, plus one-fifth of it, and give "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the one he has wronged. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if the man has no "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "redeemer, Heb. goel"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "relative to whom restitution may be made for the wrong, the restitution for the wrong "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "must go"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for the priest, in addition to the ram of the atonement with which atonement is made for him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Every offering"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "heave offering"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of all the holy things of the children of Israel, which they bring to the priest, shall be his. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And every man’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "consecrated"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "holy things shall be his; whatever any man gives the priest shall be his.’ ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Concerning Unfaithful Wives"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spoke to Moses, saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Speak to the children of Israel, and say to them: ‘If any man’s wife goes astray and behaves unfaithfully toward him, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and a man lies with her carnally, and it is hidden from the eyes of her husband, and it is concealed that she has defiled herself, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " no witness against her, nor was she caught— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "if the spirit of jealousy comes upon him and he becomes jealous of his wife, who has defiled herself; or if the spirit of jealousy comes upon him and he becomes jealous of his wife, although she has not defiled herself— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "then the man shall bring his wife to the priest. He shall bring the offering required for her, one-tenth of an ephah of barley meal; he shall pour no oil on it and put no frankincense on it, because it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a grain offering of jealousy, an offering for remembering, for bringing iniquity to remembrance."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "‘And the priest shall bring her near, and set her before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The priest shall take holy water in an earthen vessel, and take some of the dust that is on the floor of the tabernacle and put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " into the water. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the priest shall stand the woman before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", uncover the woman’s head, and put the offering for remembering in her hands, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the grain offering of jealousy. And the priest shall have in his hand the bitter water that brings a curse. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest shall put her under oath, and say to the woman, “If no man has lain with you, and if you have not gone astray to uncleanness "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "while"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " under your husband’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "authority,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " be free from this bitter water that brings a curse. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if you have gone astray "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "while"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " under your husband’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "authority,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and if you have defiled yourself and some man other than your husband has lain with you”— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "then the priest shall put the woman under the oath of the curse, and he shall say to the woman—“the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " make you a curse and an oath among your people, when the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " makes your thigh "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. fall away"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "rot and your belly swell; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and may this water that causes the curse go into your stomach, and make "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " belly swell and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " thigh rot.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "‘Then the woman shall say, “Amen, so be it.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "‘Then the priest shall write these curses in a book, and he shall scrape "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " off into the bitter water. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he shall make the woman drink the bitter water that brings a curse, and the water that brings the curse shall enter her "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to become"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " bitter. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the priest shall take the grain offering of jealousy from the woman’s hand, shall wave the offering before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", and bring it to the altar; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and the priest shall take a handful of the offering, as its memorial portion, burn "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the altar, and afterward make the woman drink the water. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When he has made her drink the water, then it shall be, if she has defiled herself and behaved unfaithfully toward her husband, that the water that brings a curse will enter her "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and become"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " bitter, and her belly will swell, her thigh will rot, and the woman will become a curse among her people. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if the woman has not defiled herself, and is clean, then she shall be free and may conceive children."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "‘This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the law of jealousy, when a wife, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "while"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " under her husband’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "authority,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " goes astray and defiles herself, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "or when the spirit of jealousy comes upon a man, and he becomes jealous of his wife; then he shall stand the woman before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", and the priest shall execute all this law upon her. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the man shall be free from "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "guilt"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "iniquity, but that woman shall bear her "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "iniquity"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "guilt.’ ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}